WEBVTT

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:02.358
because back when I used
to represent clients there,

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:06.237
stories of rape, harassment
and abuse were common.

00:06:07.238 --> 00:06:10.658
Eventually, the county
lost a few hundred jobs.

00:06:11.242 --> 00:06:13.452
Even the Walmart shut down.

00:06:14.578 --> 00:06:18.707
But then, in the summer of 2018,

00:06:18.707 --> 00:06:23.087
when the refurbished prison
was ramping up to reopen,

00:06:23.129 --> 00:06:26.006
the county's elected officials celebrated.

00:06:26.799 --> 00:06:29.135
Why was the county so interested?

00:06:29.135 --> 00:06:32.763
It owned the prison,
and the private company just ran it.